  "FR_TERMS_OF_SERVICE_TEXT": "<h1>TERMS OF SERVICE</h1>        <br>        <p>Any use of ROOMTODO service hosted on the top-level domain http://roomtodo.com  and/or integrated into the partner sites, owned by Realist Digital, means that you have read, understood and agree to the terms of the agreement below, and undertake to comply with them and be liable for their violation. The terms of this Agreement and its appendices are material and bounding on all service members.</p>        <br>                <h2>I. General terms</h2>        <p>1.1.\tThe User guarantees that he is not subject to the legal restrictions on the use of online services, that he has all the necessary authority to enter into this Agreement, or obtain the necessary permits in the form required by law from his parents or legal representatives.</p>        <p>1.2.\tThis Agreement, including all appendices hereto, for the sake of brevity, hereinafter shall be referred to as the Agreement. All appendices to the Agreement shall be its integral part and shall be binding on the Parties. Appendices to the Agreement shall be posted by the administration on the service website.  </p>        <p>1.3. This Agreement may be amended or supplemented by ROOMTODO service owner -  Realist Digital (hereinafter – the Owner) at any time, including by posting (publishing) its new version. The Owner shall notify the User of amending and supplementing the Agreement through the website administrator by any of the following ways: publication on ROOMTODO service website, sending a message to the User an e-mail message, posting the information message within ROOMTODO service, including through the publication of the text of amendments and supplements within ROOMTODO service. After receiving such a message, the User agrees to immediately read the amendments and supplements made to the Agreement. The User’s further participation in ROOMTODO service upon the receipt of notification of amendments and supplements to the Agreement s